yarn-error.log*
.yarn/cache
.npm/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# ── Tauri / Rust ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cargo workspace (M2.3 split) shares one build dir at the repo root.
/target/
network/target/
*.rlib
Cargo.lock
# ...but DO track the root workspace lock: OpenHydra ships binaries, so builds, CI, and
# releases must be reproducible and auditable (see .github/workflows/security.yml). Mirrors
# the desktop lock negation further down this file.
!/Cargo.lock

